
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.Base64ToString(Text: string): string`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`string llBase64ToString(string Text);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p class="deprecated-text"><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>Deprecated:  use llbase64.decode</span></p>
      <p>  <p>Returns a string that is the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Base64" target="_blank">Base64</a> <b>str</b> decoded into a conventional string, interpreting the Base64-encoded bytes as UTF-8 character sequence.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>string</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>string</span></td>
          <td>Text / str</td>
          <td>Base64 string</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Categories</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>data_conversion</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">Energy</span><span class="tech-val">10</span></div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">LSO ID</span><span class="tech-val">261</span></div>

      <div class="label-stack">
        <span class="attr-label bg-pure">Side-Effect Free</span>
        <span class="lua-section attr-label bg-deprecated">Lua Deprecated</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <h2>Caveats</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>If the conversion creates any unprintable characters, they are converted to spaces.</li>
    <li>Converts invalid characters into question marks ('?').</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Examples</h2>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`local function main()
    local test = ll.Base64ToString("U2VjcmV0Ok9wZW4=")
    ll.Say(0, test)
end

main()
`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`default {
    state_entry()
    {
        string test = llBase64ToString("U2VjcmV0Ok9wZW4=");
        llSay(0,test );
    }
}`} lang="lsl" /></div>
  <p>This can be used in [](https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/File:Wikipedia-16px.png)&#8201;<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Basic_access_authentication" target="_blank">Basic Authentication</a>, such as this login:</p>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`GET / HTTP/1.1
User-Agent: Mozilla/4.0 (compatible; MSIE 7.0; Windows NT 5.2)
Host: www.example.com
Authorization: Basic U2VjcmV0Ok9wZW4=`} lang="lsl" /></div>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.Base64ToString("U2VjcmV0Ok9wZW4=")  --will return the string "Secret:Open"`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`llBase64ToString("U2VjcmV0Ok9wZW4="); //will return the string "Secret:Open"`} lang="lsl" /></div>
